# Gin Martini — stirred, up.
#
# The base gin is the $brand parameter: `do martini with Crowsfoot`
# pours that gin; bare `do martini` uses the house pour. A script is a
# shortcut over the steps a player can type by hand, never a way to craft:
# each step still meets its own verb's gates. Authored here by hand to
# show the *authored-as-content* source (see scripting.md).
def martini ($brand) {
  pour $brand into mixing glass
  pour vermouth into mixing glass
  stir mixing glass
  strain mixing glass into glass
}
